<section class="page hydrate"><header class="page-head"><h1>Hydration timing</h1><p class="segment-render">this segment rendered at page render {{ renders }}</p></header><aside class="note"><b>Three islands, three schedules.</b> Each island below is the same component registered under a different timing. The first mounts on load, the second when it scrolls into view, the third when the browser is idle. Each stamps the moment it mounted, measured from navigation start, so the order and the gaps are the demonstration.</aside><article class="card stamp-card"><h2>On load</h2>{{ island(module="components/MountStamp.tsx#load", props=stamp_load) }}</article><div class="spacer"><p>Scroll. The next island sits well below the fold and its module is not even fetched until it is about to be seen.</p></div><article class="card stamp-card"><h2>When visible</h2>{{ island(module="components/MountStamp.tsx#visible", props=stamp_visible) }}</article><div class="spacer"><p>The last island mounts whenever the browser reports itself idle, which on a quiet page is a few milliseconds after load and on a busy one is later.</p></div><article class="card stamp-card"><h2>When idle</h2>{{ island(module="components/MountStamp.tsx#idle", props=stamp_idle) }}</article></section>
